[I] Port of UDPcast file transfer tool

[T] UDPcast sends data simultaneously to many destinations on a LAN using
[T] Ethernet multicast, so installing 15 machines takes no longer than
[T] installing two. It is used e.g. to install entire classrooms of PCs at
[T] once.

[U] https://www.udpcast.linux.lu/index.html

[A] Udpcast Authors
